// rule B origin-keying regression, INVERSE direction — local Foo.X=Quantity, package Foo.X=boolean.
// include "Foo" binds "Foo"."X" package-FIRST -> the boolean X -> a value-comparison mismatch. This
// pins the POSITIVE package-index typed retrieval (the package boolean type WAS read) AND reverse
// origin isolation (the local Quantity X was NOT used, which would have validated clean).
library "Root".
include "Foo".

concept "Check":
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Foo"."X" at least 30 'kg/m2'.
